@guide A_LochModan
@name Loch Modan
@faction Alliance
@levels 11-18
@zone Loch Modan
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Thelsamar, the Stonewrought Dam, the Ironband excavation and the eastern farms. Finish with the Dark Threat Looms chain at the dam, then head to Redridge.
@next A_Redridge

accept 224 In Defense of the King's Lands | Mountaineer Cobbleflint, the first bunker south of the tunnel.
accept The Trogg Threat | Captain Rugelfuss in the same bunker.
complete 224 In Defense of the King's Lands | Troggs on the hills around the bunkers.
complete The Trogg Threat | Trogg Stone Teeth drop from the same troggs.
turnin 224 In Defense of the King's Lands
accept 237 In Defense of the King's Lands
turnin The Trogg Threat
turnin Stout to Kadrell | Mountaineer Kadrell, Thelsamar.
accept Rat Catching
accept Mountaineer Stormpike's Task
accept Thelsamar Blood Sausages
fp Thelsamar
bind Thelsamar
accept WANTED: Chok'sul [elite; group=3; optional]
complete Thelsamar Blood Sausages | Bears and spiders around Thelsamar.
complete Rat Catching | Tunnel Rat Kobolds at the Silver Stream Mine, north of Thelsamar.
turnin Thelsamar Blood Sausages
turnin Rat Catching
complete 237 In Defense of the King's Lands | Stonesplinter troggs at Grizzlepaw Ridge.
turnin 237 In Defense of the King's Lands
accept 263 In Defense of the King's Lands
turnin Mountaineer Stormpike's Task | Mountaineer Stormpike at the Dam.
accept Filthy Paws
complete Filthy Paws | Kobold crates inside Silver Stream Mine.
turnin Filthy Paws
accept Stormpike's Order [optional]
accept Excavation Progress Report | Prospector Ironband, Ironband's Excavation Site.
accept Gathering Idols | Magmar Fellhew at the excavation.
turnin Excavation Progress Report | Jern Hornhelm in Thelsamar.
accept Report to Ironforge
accept Ironband's Excavation
turnin Ironband's Excavation
complete Gathering Idols | Troggs at the excavation site drop Carved Stone Idols.
turnin Gathering Idols
accept Crocolisk Hunting | Marek Ironheart at the Farstrider Lodge, east Loch Modan.
accept A Hunter's Boast | Daryl the Youngling, Farstrider Lodge.
accept Bingles' Missing Supplies | Bingles Blastenheimer, on the hill north-east of Thelsamar.
complete A Hunter's Boast | Mountain Buzzards and boars near the lodge.
turnin A Hunter's Boast
accept A Hunter's Challenge
complete Crocolisk Hunting | Loch Crocolisks along the eastern shore.
complete Bingles' Missing Supplies | Four pieces scattered at the Thelsamar lake islands.
turnin Bingles' Missing Supplies
complete A Hunter's Challenge | Elder Mountain Boars south of the lodge.
turnin A Hunter's Challenge
turnin Crocolisk Hunting
complete 263 In Defense of the King's Lands | Troggs at the southern Stonesplinter Valley.
turnin 263 In Defense of the King's Lands
accept 217 In Defense of the King's Lands
complete 217 In Defense of the King's Lands | Kill Stonesplinter troggs in Stonesplinter Valley.
turnin 217 In Defense of the King's Lands
turnin Report to Ironforge [optional] | Prospector Stormpike in the Hall of Explorers, Ironforge. Train while you are there.
accept Mercenaries | Magistrate Bluntnose, Thelsamar.
complete Mercenaries | Mo'grosh ogres at the north-east of the loch.
turnin Mercenaries
accept 250 A Dark Threat Looms | Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII on the Stonewrought Dam.
turnin 250 A Dark Threat Looms | The suspicious barrel is on the dam.
accept 199 A Dark Threat Looms
turnin 199 A Dark Threat Looms
accept 161 A Dark Threat Looms
turnin 161 A Dark Threat Looms [optional] | Ashlan Stonesmirk in the Wetlands. Leave it if you are going straight to Redridge.
level 17 | Finish leftover kills here if you are not 17 yet.
train
note Fly from Thelsamar to Ironforge, take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind, and walk east through Elwynn to Redridge.
